    "id": "auth-ni-45-106-2.1.1",
    "organizationId": "preview",
    "title": "NI 45-106 s. 2.1.1 — Rights offering — stand-by commitment",
    "content": "Section 2.1.1 — Rights offering — stand-by commitment\n\n2.1.1 The prospectus requirement does not apply to the distribution of a security by an issuer to a stand-by guarantor as part of a distribution under section 2.1 if the stand-by guarantor acquires the security as principal. Rights offering – issuer with a minimal connection to Canada Refer to Appendix E of National Instrument 45-102 Resale of Securities. First trades are subject to a seasoning period on resale.\n\nCross-references: s. 2.1.\n\nSource: NI 45-106 unofficial consolidation current to 2025-12-04.",
