    "content": "Section 2.28 — Limitations re: permitted transferees\n\n2.28 The exemption from the prospectus requirement under subsection 2.27(1) or (2) is only available if the security was acquired\n\n(a) by a person described in section 2.24(1) [Employee, executive officer, director, and consultant] under any exemption that makes the resale of the security subject to section 2.6 of National Instrument 45-102 Resale of Securities, or (b) in Manitoba, by a person described in section 2.24(1) [Employee, executive officer, director, and consultant]. Issuer bid\n\nCross-references: s. 2.24; s. 2.6.\n\nSource: NI 45-106 unofficial consolidation current to 2025-12-04.",
