    "content": "Section 2.40 — Personal property security legislation\n\n2.40 The prospectus requirement does not apply to a distribution of a security between (a) an individual or an associate of the individual, and (b) a RRSP, RRIF, or TFSA (i) established for or by the individual, or (ii) under which the individual is a beneficiary. Schedule III banks and cooperative associations - evidence of deposit This provision is not cited in any Appendix of National Instrument 45-102 Resale of Securities. These securities are free trading.\n\nSource: NI 45-106 unofficial consolidation current to 2025-12-04.",
