    "title": "NI 45-106 s. 5.3 — Underwriter exemption (TSX Venture)",
    "content": "Section 5.3 — Underwriter exemption (TSX Venture) (continued, part 2)\n\n(2) An issuer must close the distribution referred to in section 5A.2 no later than the 45th day after the date the issuer issues and files the news release referred to in paragraph 5A.2(k). Special application – Alberta, British Columbia, New Brunswick and Québec 5A.5(1) In Alberta, a document that purports or appears to be completed in accordance with\n\nCross-references: Part 8; Form 45-106F19.\n\nSource: NI 45-106 unofficial consolidation current to 2025-12-04.",
