    "title": "NI 45-106 s. 8.4.1 — Transitional — s. 2.9(5.1) cross-reference (Alberta, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, Québec)",
    "content": "Section 8.4.1 — Transitional — s. 2.9(5.1) cross-reference (Alberta, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, Québec)\n\n8.4.1 Despite subsection 2.9(5.1), in Alberta, New Brunswick, Nova Scotia, Québec and Saskatchewan, an issuer is not required to update an offering memorandum that was filed in the local jurisdiction before April 30, 2016, solely to incorporate the statement required under paragraph 2.9(5.1)(a), unless the offering memorandum would otherwise be required to be updated pursuant to subsection 2.9(14) or Instruction B.12 of Form 45-106F2 Offering Memorandum for Non-Qualifying Issuers. Transition – offering memorandum exemption – marketing materials\n\nCross-references: Form 45-106F2.\n\nSource: NI 45-106 unofficial consolidation current to 2025-12-04.",
